{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg8p3z48ETB1rb1eR2cDU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the player page's unmount hook and committed it, but I haven't done the two manual checks, so both checklist items are still unchecked.\n\n**The fix** (`src/renderer/pages/player-page.js`):\n1. The hook was called `onComponentWillUnmount`, so React never ran it. It is now `componentWillUnmount`.\n2. It now unloads every `audio,video` element on the page, both the main player and `video#preview`. It pauses each one, removes its `src` attribute and calls `load()`. The old code only touched the first element it found. It also set `src = ''`, which makes the element try to load the page's own URL.\n3. It always sets the media session metadata back to `null`, so the next play sets a fresh title. Before, an early return skipped this when no media element was found.\n4. It also clears the play, pause, next-track and previous-track handlers. The page only registers next and previous when the playlist has them, so without this a stale handler from the last play could stay attached. Each clear sits in a try block in case the webview doesn't support that action.\n\n**Testing:** I didn't write an automated test. The spec says the page lifecycle can't be automated because pages can't be loaded in the unit suite, and the ticket says to check it by hand. `npm test` passes: lint, depcheck, the build and all 4224 unit tests.\n\n**Still to do by hand** in the running app:\n- [ ] Manual check: play one file, close the player, play a different file, and the system media controls show the second file's title\n- [ ] Manual check: after closing the player, the main and preview media elements no longer hold a source\n\nI added a short note to `src/renderer/pages/AGENTS.md`: a misnamed React lifecycle hook fails silently, and the next play's media session metadata depends on this reset. My notes are in `.nightralph/notes.md`, which is not committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1133,"cache_read_input_tokens":51981,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1133},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"13e2c60c-45b8-4fbe-9566-585462c93ca3","uuid":"171a5a31-db9d-4d06-bc25-8d92e4268eac","timestamp":"2026-10-18T01:11:10.407Z","request_id":"req_011Cg8p3yoFKUTHQB8ik8KZX"}
